1. THE MANUSCRIPT AND ALL BOOK CONTENT: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
===============================================================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel S. Wipert. All rights reserved.

This section covers the book itself and everything written in service of it:

  Drafts/                    chapter text, working drafts, and stage artifacts
  Northmoor/                 the constructed dataset and its notes
  archive/                   superseded drafts and retired working files
  web_templates/             site templates, including the landing page text
  AIOM_book.css              the print design system
  AIOM_web.css               the web presentation layer
  AIOM_*.md                  specifications, ledgers, plans, and standards
  AIOM_*.docx, AIOM_*.xlsx   the addendum and the validation matrix
  CLAUDE.md, HANDOFF.md      project instructions and session records

The two stylesheets are placed here rather than under the code license because
they are the book's visual identity rather than general-purpose tooling.

No license is granted in this material. You may read it and you may quote
briefly from it with attribution, as fair use and ordinary scholarly practice
allow. You may not reproduce it at length, redistribute it, publish it, adapt
it, translate it, or use it to train a model, without written permission.

The repository is public so that the web edition can be built and served from
it. Public visibility is not a grant of any right in the text.


