===============================================================================
3. THE FONTS: SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE 1.1
===============================================================================

fonts/ holds IBM Plex Sans and Jost, both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
and neither is covered by sections 1 or 2. Their license texts are committed
beside them as the OFL requires:

  fonts/OFL-IBMPlexSans.txt
  fonts/OFL-Jost.txt

The fonts are committed so that a print or web render needs no network access.


